# 30. PERSONAL VS ENTERPRISE

| Personal | Enterprise |
|---|---|
| Shared credential model | Individual/user/device authentication |
| Easier for homes/small networks | Suitable for organizations |
| WPA2-PSK / WPA3-SAE | 802.1X/EAP |
| One shared secret is common | Centralized authentication |

### Memory

> **Personal = Password**

> **Enterprise = Identity**

