# 33. ENCRYPTION VS AUTHENTICATION

Very important distinction.

### Authentication

> **Who is allowed to connect?**

### Encryption

> **How is communication protected from unauthorized reading?**

Example:

```text
Authentication
     ↓
Verify client
     ↓
Key establishment
     ↓
Encrypted communication
```

