# 59. AP ADMINISTRATION SECURITY

The wireless password and AP administrator password are different concepts.

Secure the management interface using:

- Strong administrator credentials
- MFA where supported
- HTTPS/secure management
- Restricted management access
- Firmware updates
- Network segmentation

